{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And between the unclean and between the clean.</b> In animal and in water creature and in bird — therefore after this section was written the section of \"this is the animal,\" and afterward the uncleanness of a woman who gives birth, and the leprosy of man, garment, and house, and one with a discharge, and the zav and zavah, and the menstruant. And this is the meaning of \"and between the unclean and between the clean.\""], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:17.729886628Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}